# A chat archived on another device can be continued here. The station check verifies both the message and that its
# session is back in the list, rather than just the composer's optimistic message.
#before peer archive 归档发送测试 {T} post:归档前的回复 {T}
timeout 90000
until 端到端测试
tap icon:filter
until =已归档
tap =已归档
until 归档发送测试 {T}
tap 归档发送测试 {T}
until 已归档，发送消息将还原
tap 发消息
type 继续处理 {T}
tap icon:arrow-up
answered chat.send
